      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling is a profound and painful distortion of reality, and it's a sign of how deeply you are hurting right now. The idea that your presence is a burden is a lie your exhaustion is telling you; your children need *you*, even when you feel broken. Instead of trying to carry this crushing weight alone, consider reaching out to a professional who can help you manage this intense emotional pain. There are people who want to support you through this difficult time.",
