      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The thought that letting go would be an act of love is a classic, desperate trap that your pain is setting for you. Truly loving your children means being there for them, even when you feel you are failing, because they need your presence, not your absence. The struggle you feel is a sign that you need relief, not that you are disposable. Please, make the choice to let someone else help carry this unbearable weight with you right now.",
